  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ladrillo Verde Supporting Rural Families</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is located in Punta Hacienda, a rural population in the mountain, has no drinking water or sewage system, approximately 270 low-income families living there, children with malnutrition, abandoned and sick elderly people and also feeling hungry every day without access to basic medicines or food. This population managed to build a medical center with plastic bottles used as bricks, recycling 20,000 plastic bottles, this community needs support to activate their space.</narrative>
  </description>
